[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダさんの協力もあり、ホーフナ州の大穴で\n素材を発見。すべての素材が揃いました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks to Criselda's help, we found the material in the Great Pit of Hofner. Now we have everything we need."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これからヴァレリアの核を修復するための\n調合を行います",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll begin the synthesis to repair Valeria's core."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃんのレシピは完璧だったもん。\n落ち着いてやれば大丈夫だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your recipe is perfect, Resna. Just take it nice and slow, and you'll do great!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、絶対にできるよ。頑張ろう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's right. You can do this! Let's give it our all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アーシャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア……今、治すからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria... I'll fix you up now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ。相棒のこと、よろしく頼むよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna. I'm counting on you to take care of my partner."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フロッケたちも、信じています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We believe in you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。任せてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ヴァレリア……\n\u3000たとえあなたが記憶を無くしてしまっても）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Valeria... Even if you lose your memories...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私が全部、覚えてるから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I'll remember everything for both of us.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あなたがくれた想いを、今度は私が返したい）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I want to return to you all those precious moments we shared.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私もヴァレリアが大好きだよって\n\u3000ちゃんと伝えるんだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I want to properly tell you how much I care about you.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だから、どうか……どうか）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(So please... please...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇ、レスナ。今度は普通に友達になってね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Resna? Let's become friends the normal way next time, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（目を覚まして、ヴァレリア！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Wake up, Valeria!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "成功したようですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems you've succeeded."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "できました。これが、ヴァレリアの核を\n修復するための道具……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I did it. This is the tool that will repair Valeria's core..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "名付けて、「創世の光石」です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I call it the 'Stone of Creation.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
